---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy">
  <section class="page-heading">
    <span class="eyebrow">SIMPLE BY DESIGN</span>
    <h1>Your browsing, respected.</h1>
    <p>A public catalog with no account required.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="glass-panel prose">
    <h2>What this website uses</h2>
    <p>
      The application does not include analytics, advertising, tracking cookies, or user accounts.
      Search and filter preferences are stored in the page URL so you can share a filtered
      collection.
    </p>
    <h2>Public listings</h2>
    <p>
      The server requests public project metadata from GitHub, VS Code Marketplace, Microsoft Edge
      Add-ons, npm, crates.io, and PyPI. Project icons load from their original providers; those
      requests may disclose your IP address to the image host.
    </p>
    <h2>Hosting and external links</h2>
    <p>
      The hosting provider may process request information such as IP addresses and server logs
      under its own privacy policy. External project links are governed by their respective
      services.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>
      Contact the maker through{' '}
      <a href="https://github.com/kirasync2748" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        the GitHub profile
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
